        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 24px 72px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;\">\n  <span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:var(--color-deep-blue,#2C4E6B);color:#fff;font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:9999px;margin-bottom:28px;\">AI 글쓰기 · 1인 사업</span>\n\n  <p class=\"section-title-2line__small\" style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px);color:#6B6B6B;letter-spacing:-0.015em;margin:0 0 10px;line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;\">직장 그만두기 전에 먼저 찍어봤습니다.</p>\n\n  <h1 class=\"section-title-2line\" style=\"font-family:'GmarketSans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,58px);font-weight:700;color:#1F1F1F;letter-spacing:-0.028em;line-height:1.22;word-break:keep-all;margin:0 0 28px;\">퇴근 후 2시간,<br>월 500 남깁니다.</h1>\n\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,18px);color:#4A4A4A;line-height:1.72;letter-spacing:-0.018em;word-break:keep-all;margin:0 0 12px;max-width:520px;\">매일 밤 11시, 회의록 정리하고 보고서 쓰다 지쳤다면 —<br>그 글쓰기 시간을 그대로 돈으로 바꾸는 방법이 있습니다.</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,1.9vw,16px);color:#6B6B6B;line-height:1.68;letter-spacing:-0.015em;word-break:keep-all;margin:0 0 40px;max-width:480px;\">블로그 글 1개 쓰는 데 3시간? 지금은 22분입니다.</p>\n\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;\">\n    <a href=\"#enroll\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;background:#D85A30;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-0.01em;display:inline-block;\">무료 맛보기 보러 가기</a>\n    <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B;letter-spacing:-0.01em;\">수강생 1,240명 · 평균 별점 4.8</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #E5DFD3;width:100%;margin:48px 0 36px;\">\n\n  <ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:32px;\">\n    <li style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B;letter-spacing:-0.015em;line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;\">\n      <strong style=\"display:block;font-family:'Gotham','Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1F1F1F;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">22분</strong>\n      블로그 글 1개 완성\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B;letter-spacing:-0.015em;line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;\">\n      <strong style=\"display:block;font-family:'Gotham','Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1F1F1F;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">8주</strong>\n      첫 수익 확인까지\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"font-family:'Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#6B6B6B;letter-spacing:-0.015em;line-height:1.6;word-break:keep-all;\">\n      <strong style=\"display:block;font-family:'Gotham','Pretendard Variable',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1F1F1F;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;\">1,240명</strong>\n      함께 시작한 수강생\n    </li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
